---
title: Order states
---
stateDiagram-v2
  %% An order's life: payment can be declined, and fulfilment packs and ships.
  direction LR
  [*] --> Draft
  state "Waiting for payment" as Waiting
  Draft --> Waiting : submit
  Waiting --> approved
  state approved <<choice>>
  approved --> Paid : card approved
  approved --> Draft : declined
  Paid : Receipt sent

  state Fulfilment {
    [*] --> Packing
    Packing --> Shipped
    Shipped --> [*]
  }
  Paid --> Fulfilment
  Fulfilment --> Delivered
  Delivered --> [*]

  note right of Waiting : Cancelled after 24 hours
  classDef happy fill:#58e39b
  class Paid, Delivered happy
